@startuml
' Figure 25.1  The loop, step by step
' Reading order: top to bottom, then back up the left side. The harness
' assembles what the model sees, the model proposes one step, the
' gateway runs or refuses it, the observation lands in the trail and the
' next context, and the harness, not the model, checks the stops.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
start
repeat
  :Harness assembles context; <<ops>>
  :Model proposes one step; <<model>>
  :Gateway runs or refuses it; <<ops>>
  :Observation to trail and context; <<ops>>
repeat while (Harness: a stop met?) is (no)
->yes;
:Stop, with the reason; <<ops>>
stop
@enduml
